        | `Capture Page Screenshot` |                                        |
        | `File Should Exist`       | ${OUTPUTDIR}/selenium-screenshot-1.png |
        | ${path} =                 | `Capture Page Screenshot`              |
        | `File Should Exist`       | ${OUTPUTDIR}/selenium-screenshot-2.png |
